data: {"id": "08e85b01624a4e5d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1404", "run_id": "08e85b01624a4e5d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 实体与生命周期确认\n\n- **实体**: `aiops-case-v09/workload` (Pod UID `5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305`, 容器 `app`, 节点 `node2`, IP `172.16.104.20`)\n- **当前状态**: `Running` (Pod 层面), 但容器状态为 `Waiting / CrashLoopBackOff`, `Ready=False`。\n- **重启次数**: 15 次 (Prometheus `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=15`)\n- **事件**: `BackOff` 事件已持续约 58 分钟 (x245 次指数退避)。\n\n## 支持候选原因的证据 (CrashLoopBackOffRuntime)\n\n### 1. 直接崩溃原因：配置文件缺失导致进程退出\n- **kubectl_describe** 确认 `Last State: Terminated`, `Reason: Error`, `Exit Code: 1`。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789139440610, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

