data: {"id": "08e85b01624a4e5d-final", "run_id": "08e85b01624a4e5d", "seq": 1409, "ts_ms": 1789139455247, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v09/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod 容器 command 尝试读取 '/input/app.conf' 但文件不存在（EmptyDir 卷未挂载配置源），导致进程抛出 FileNotFoundError 退出并反复进入 CrashLoopBackOff。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `container.last_terminated_reason` | `reason: Error` (Exit Code: 1) | 确认容器以错误状态终止 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` | `CrashLoopBackOff` (Back-off 5m0s) | 确认异常循环状态及退避机制 |\n| 3 | Logging | `python traceback` | `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'` | 提供具体的代码错误堆栈，指向缺失文件 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` | `reason: Error` | 验证容器终止原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` | `reason: CrashLoopBackOff` | 验证当前 Pod 等待原因 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | `container.command` (inferred from logs) | `from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())` | 暴露导致错误的执行逻辑 |\n\n**证据关联与印证说明：**\nKubernetes 状态显示容器不断重启且处于 CrashLoopBackOff（证据 #1, #2），Metric 数据从监控层面独立印证了相同的 Error/CrashLoopBackOff 状态（证据 #4, #5）。日志（证据 #3）直接捕获了 Python 进程读取 `/input/app.conf` 失败的具体 `FileNotFoundError`，这揭示了导致上述所有循环重启和状态异常的具体技术细节。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置文件挂载配置缺失 → 启动命令尝试读取 /input/app.conf → 抛出 FileNotFoundError 退出 (Exit Code 1) → 容器 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**Pod 的启动配置错误（配置源缺失）**。\n\n*   容器的主进程（Python 脚本）试图读取路径 `/input/app.conf`，但该文件实际不存在。\n*   这一缺失导致进程直接抛出 `FileNotFoundError` 并以 Exit Code 1 退出，触发 Kubernetes 的重启机制，随后进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n*   核心事实依据为日志中明确记录的 FileNotFoundError 堆栈信息（证据 #3），以及容器不断重启的状态（证据 #1, #2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v09/workload: 39.3s (Evidence 32.9s, RCA 6.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v09/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.128, "metrics": {"run_id": "08e85b01624a4e5d", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.1497483253479, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64149.7483253479, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 60909.128189086914, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7700.517892837524, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2867.9771423339844}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 1